GFOpenTorrent: three dialogs without wx's implicit wxString to std::string
conversion, which the GFOpenWX Toolkit builds off
(wxUSE_STD_STRING_CONV_IN_WXSTRING 0): they call ToStdString(). The
create-torrent dialog adds its three modes one by one, as wxChoice's
Append of a braced list is ambiguous there.
